    "text": "wnky.com\nwebsite\nMorgantown\nMorgantown’s Aerospace Composite Solutions to receive 2025 Kentucky Aviation Achievement Award\nBy WNKY Staff,\n10 hours agoMORGANTOWN, Ky. — The Aviation Museum of Kentucky has announced Aerospace Composite Solutions will receive the 2025 Kentucky Aviation Hall of Fame Aviation Achievement Award. The award will be presented at the Hall of Fame Induction Ceremony on Nov. 1 in Lexington, with the event starting at 5 p.m.",
